
== 1. Inputs ===================================================
  beta matrix: 48 probes x 1028 cell lines
  probes: RASSF9 12 | RASSF10 36

== 2. Assigning a lineage to all 1028 lines ================
  lines matched to a DepMap lineage: 996 of 1028 (96.9%)
  melanoma (non-uveal)            : 56
  other lines WITH a lineage      : 940
  unmatched (excluded from tests) : 32

  NOTE: 44b used all 972 non-melanoma columns as the baseline. Here the
  baseline is restricted to lines with a known lineage, so the pooled
  numbers may differ slightly from 44b. That is intentional -- the
  lineage test requires the annotation.

== 3. Per-line scores ==========================================
  RASSF9: scored 996 lines
  RASSF10: scored 996 lines

== 4. Melanoma vs other lineages, by probe set =================
  core is the test; shore and distal are pre-specified negative controls
  core_minus_distal normalises each line against itself

