    core probes raised at BH p < 0.05 : 5 of 5
    core-minus-distal shift           : +0.262, p = 0.00e+00
    melanoma rank among lineages      : 1 of 21
    control sets also significant     : shore 0, distal 0

  RASSF10: LINEAGE-SHARED
    core probes raised at BH p < 0.05 : 4 of 9
    core-minus-distal shift           : +0.047, p = 1.87e-01
